### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /api/v1/sub-orders/{id} — Get sub-order by ID
### SubOrderController.getSubOrder
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@subOrderBase = {{host}}/api/v1/sub-orders

###
# @name get-sub-order-ok
### [1] Happy path (expect 200)
GET {{subOrderBase}}/{{subOrderId}}

###
# @name get-sub-order-not-found
### [2] Non-existent UUID (expect 404)
GET {{subOrderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}

###
# @name get-sub-order-malformed-id
### [3] Malformed UUID (expect 400)
GET {{subOrderBase}}/not-a-uuid
